│ patch_description        │ Improve the path generator with two coordinated changes aimed at lowering combined score: │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 1) **Proxy objective upgrade**: add a **bi-Laplacian bending penalty** (4th-order         │
│                          │ smoothness) so the optimizer can maintain globally smooth curvature while still creating  │
│                          │ a stronger local deflection away from school and toward base. At the same time, slightly  │
│                          │ rebalance weights to prioritize school avoidance more (current F2 is the main weakness)   │
│                          │ while keeping distance and signal terms active.                                           │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 2) **Deterministic post-CEM shape refinement**: replace simple averaging with a short,    │
│                          │ stable relaxation pass that combines:                                                     │
│                          │ - Laplacian + bi-Laplacian smoothing (smooth yet controllable bend),                      │
│                          │ - localized school repulsion around school x-position,                                    │
│                          │ - localized base attraction around base x-position,                                       │
│                          │ - mild tether to the current best path and baseline line.                                 │
│                          │ This typically improves F2/F3 trade-off without introducing jaggedness or large F1        │
│                          │ growth.                                                                                   │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ These edits are targeted, deterministic, and remain lightweight for runtime.              │
