│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ surrogate_guided_s_curve                                                                  │
│ patch_description        │ This rewrite replaces the single-pass heuristic with a fast surrogate-guided search over  │
│                          │ smooth path families.                                                                     │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Key ideas:                                                                                │
│                          │ 1. Start from the straight line to keep F1 low.                                           │
│                          │ 2. Add a smooth repulsion bump near the school, pushing the path away from the school     │
│                          │ side.                                                                                     │
│                          │ 3. Add a broader asymmetric attraction toward the base station so the drone descends      │
│                          │ earlier and stays in better signal regions longer, targeting F3.                          │
│                          │ 4. Search a small deterministic grid of amplitudes using a surrogate objective that       │
│                          │ jointly balances:                                                                         │
│                          │    - path length,                                                                         │
│                          │    - school proximity,                                                                    │
│                          │    - base distance / signal quality,                                                      │
│                          │    - smoothness.                                                                          │
│                          │ 5. Perform a light smoothing pass with fixed endpoints to remove local kinks without      │
│                          │ erasing the intended bend.                                                                │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This is still very cheap to run, but much more adaptive than the previous static formula. │
│                          │ It is especially tuned for the stated geometry: bending away from the school region       │
│                          │ around (40, 20) and then toward the base region around (70, -30), while keeping the line  │
│                          │ smooth and not overly long.                                                               │
