│ patch_description        │ This edit introduces the optimization of the influence centers (x-positions) for the      │
│                          │ school repulsion and base station attraction Gaussians. By allowing the centers to move,  │
│                          │ the path can more flexibly navigate around the school and towards the base station.       │
│                          │ Additionally, a 'fade' factor is introduced to the curve perturbations to ensure the path │
│                          │ smoothly anchors to the start and end points, which improves both the distance (F1) and   │
│                          │ smoothness scores. The local search optimizer and surrogate evaluator weights are also    │
│                          │ refined to better balance the three objectives.                                           │
